---
// BattleRoom on AWS, drawn from the facts in CLAUDE.md (no architecture image was provided).
---

<figure class="arch">
  <div class="arch-scroll" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Architecture diagram, scrolls sideways on small screens">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 960 560" width="960" height="560" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-title arch-desc">
      <title id="arch-title">BattleRoom architecture on AWS</title>
      <desc id="arch-desc">
        Players connect over HTTPS and WebSockets to Nginx on the app server. GitHub Actions pushes images to
        Docker Hub and deploys the exact commit SHA with Ansible over SSH. Inside one custom VPC and public subnet,
        a separate monitoring server scrapes node_exporter on port 9100 and app metrics on port 9101, which only it
        can reach. The app uses MongoDB Atlas and the Gemini API. Alertmanager and the outside uptime check post to
        Discord.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-head"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Outside AWS: left -->
      <g class="ext-box">
        <rect x="20" y="100" width="200" height="56"></rect>
        <text x="36" y="124" class="t-title">Players</text>
        <text x="36" y="143" class="t-sub">browser</text>
      </g>
      <g class="ext-box">
        <rect x="20" y="206" width="200" height="104"></rect>
        <text x="36" y="231" class="t-title">GitHub Actions</text>
        <text x="36" y="252" class="t-sub">5-job pipeline on push</text>
        <text x="36" y="271" class="t-sub">uptime check every 15 min</text>
        <text x="36" y="290" class="t-sub">rollback by old SHA</text>
      </g>
      <g class="ext-box">
        <rect x="20" y="394" width="200" height="56"></rect>
        <text x="36" y="418" class="t-title">Docker Hub</text>
        <text x="36" y="437" class="t-mono">:SHA and :latest</text>
      </g>

      <!-- AWS -->
      <rect x="258" y="20" width="444" height="520" class="aws"></rect>
      <text x="274" y="44" class="t-label">AWS · custom VPC · public subnet</text>
      <text x="686" y="44" class="t-label" text-anchor="end">internet gateway</text>

      <g class="server">
        <rect x="290" y="62" width="380" height="204"></rect>
        <text x="306" y="87" class="t-title">App server</text>
        <text x="654" y="87" class="t-sub" text-anchor="end">EC2 · Elastic IP · IMDSv2</text>
        <rect x="306" y="102" width="348" height="44" class="row"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="129" class="t-row">Nginx · Let’s Encrypt TLS · WebSocket proxy</text>
        <rect x="306" y="152" width="348" height="44" class="row"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="179" class="t-row">App container · Node.js · Socket.IO</text>
        <rect x="306" y="202" width="348" height="44" class="row"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="229" class="t-row">node_exporter <tspan class="t-mono">:9100</tspan> · app metrics <tspan class="t-mono">:9101</tspan></text>
      </g>

      <g class="server">
        <rect x="290" y="318" width="380" height="204"></rect>
        <text x="306" y="343" class="t-title">Monitoring server</text>
        <text x="654" y="343" class="t-sub" text-anchor="end">EC2 t3.micro · Elastic IP</text>
        <rect x="306" y="358" width="348" height="44" class="row"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="385" class="t-row">Nginx · the one public door</text>
        <rect x="306" y="408" width="348" height="44" class="row"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="435" class="t-row">Prometheus · Grafana · Alertmanager <tspan class="t-mono">127.0.0.1</tspan></text>
        <rect x="306" y="458" width="348" height="44" class="row"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="485" class="t-row">Blackbox exporter · HTTPS + cert expiry</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Outside AWS: right -->
      <g class="ext-box">
        <rect x="740" y="100" width="200" height="56"></rect>
        <text x="756" y="124" class="t-title">MongoDB Atlas</text>
        <text x="756" y="143" class="t-sub">database</text>
      </g>
      <g class="ext-box">
        <rect x="740" y="176" width="200" height="56"></rect>
        <text x="756" y="200" class="t-title">Gemini API</text>
        <text x="756" y="219" class="t-sub">question generation</text>
      </g>
      <g class="ext-box">
        <rect x="740" y="420" width="200" height="56"></rect>
        <text x="756" y="444" class="t-title">Discord #alerts</text>
        <text x="756" y="463" class="t-sub">Alertmanager + uptime check</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Flows -->
      <line x1="220" y1="124" x2="304" y2="124" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>
      <text x="228" y="116" class="t-flow">HTTPS · WSS</text>

      <line x1="220" y1="236" x2="304" y2="236" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>
      <text x="228" y="228" class="t-flow">deploy :SHA</text>
      <text x="228" y="253" class="t-flow">Ansible · SSH</text>

      <line x1="120" y1="310" x2="120" y2="392" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>
      <text x="128" y="356" class="t-flow">push image</text>

      <line x1="480" y1="318" x2="480" y2="268" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>
      <text x="490" y="290" class="t-flow">scrape :9100 :9101</text>
      <text x="490" y="306" class="t-flow">security group: monitoring only</text>

      <line x1="670" y1="128" x2="738" y2="128" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>
      <line x1="670" y1="204" x2="738" y2="204" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>

      <line x1="670" y1="448" x2="738" y2="448" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></line>
      <text x="678" y="440" class="t-flow">alerts</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Two EC2 instances in one custom VPC, all defined in Terraform (23 resources). The monitoring server is the only
    thing that can reach the metrics ports.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .arch { min-width: 0; }

  .arch-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 28px 28px,
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 28px 28px,
      var(--bg);
    background-blend-mode: normal;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: var(--line-2) transparent;
  }

  .arch svg {
    min-width: 720px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .aws {
    fill: rgba(200, 246, 91, 0.025);
    stroke: rgba(200, 246, 91, 0.5);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }

  .server > rect:first-child {
    fill: var(--bg-2);
    stroke: var(--line-2);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
  }

  .row {
    fill: var(--bg-3);
    stroke: var(--line);
  }

  .ext-box rect {
    fill: var(--bg-2);
    stroke: var(--line-2);
  }

  .flow {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }

  .arrow-head { fill: var(--accent); }

  text { fill: var(--text); font-family: var(--font-body); }
  .t-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; }
  .t-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--muted); }
  .t-row { font-size: 13.5px; }
  .t-mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; fill: var(--warn); }
  .t-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; fill: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  /* dark halo so labels read cleanly where they cross the dashed AWS border */
  .t-flow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--muted);
    paint-order: stroke;
    stroke: var(--bg);
    stroke-width: 5px;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
